<title>TURKEY: Mitsubishi unit in $1.5 bln Turkish plant.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi unit in $1.5 bln Turkish plant.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A consortium led by Mitsubishi Heavy Industries Ltd presented the lowest bid in Turkey's 1,400 MegaWatt coal-fired power plant tender, with a $1.51 billion offer, Turkish Energy Minister Recai Kutan said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
